# Proxyserver (JD13, eigene Grafik im JFNetworker-Stil)
master: Proxy server
name.de: Proxyserver
name.en: Proxy server
name.es: Servidor proxy
name.it: Server proxy
name.fr: Serveur proxy
prompt.de: Proxyserver: vermittelt Anfragen stellvertretend.
prompt.en: Proxy server: forwards requests on behalf of clients.
prompt.es: Servidor proxy: reenvía solicitudes en nombre de los clientes.
prompt.it: Server proxy: inoltra richieste per conto dei client.
prompt.fr: Serveur proxy : relaie les requêtes pour le compte des clients.
keywords.de: Proxyserver, Server, Rolle
keywords.en: Proxy server, server, role
keywords.es: Servidor proxy, servidor, función
keywords.it: Server proxy, server, ruolo
keywords.fr: Serveur proxy, serveur, rôle
svg: ../../symbols/network/server_proxy.svg
include: ../net_common/symbol.inc, ../net_common/asset.inc, ../net_common/network.inc, ../net_common/computer.inc

